Usage: yuxi [options] [command]

Yuxi command line client

Options:
  -V, --version     output the version number
  -h, --help        display help for command

Commands:
  remote            管理 Yuxi 远程服务
  agent             查看可用 Agent
  thread            管理 Agent Thread
  file              准备消息的 draft 文件
  kb                查询知识库
  login [options]
  whoami [options]
  status [options]
  logout [options]
  chat [options]
  help [command]    display help for command
